ent-ClothingHeadProtoVisorBasic = Cybernetic Visor
    .desc = Highly specialized equipment used for providing additional data about the environment (or so they advertise) and causing the user permanent vision problems. The most common, simplest model.
ent-ClothingHeadProtoVisorSpaceProof = Space Proof Cybernetic Visor
    .desc = Highly specialized equipment used for providing additional data about the environment (or so they advertise) and causing the user permanent vision problems. This version comes with additional seals to make it space proof.
ent-ClothingHeadProtoVisorEngi = Engineer's Cybernetic Visor
    .desc = Highly specialized equipment used for providing additional data about the environment (or so they advertise) and causing the user permanent vision problems. This version is space proof, has a built in T-ray scanner and provides some protection against welding arcs for up to 10 seconds of continuous welding. Not as good as a designated mask, however it will adapt itself to fix the newly acquired sight error.
ent-ClothingHeadProtoVisorCE = CE's Cybernetic Visor
    .desc = Highly specialized equipment used for providing additional data about the environment (or so they advertise) and causing the user permanent vision problems. This version is space proof, comes with environment thermal sensors and allows you to weld without limits.
ent-ClothingHeadProtoVisorMedical = Doctors's Cybernetic Visor
    .desc = Highly specialized equipment used for providing additional data about the environment (or so they advertise) and causing the user permanent vision problems. This version has a built in health HUD display.
ent-ClothingHeadProtoVisorParamed = Paramedic's Cybernetic Visor
    .desc = Highly specialized equipment used for providing additional data about the environment (or so they advertise) and causing the user permanent vision problems. This version not only comes with a health HUD but also space protection.
ent-ClothingHeadProtoVisorChem = Chemist's Cybernetic Visor
    .desc = Highly specialized equipment used for providing additional data about the environment (or so they advertise) and causing the user permanent vision problems. This version, in addition to the health HUD, comes with a chemical scanner.
ent-ClothingHeadProtoVisorCMO = CMO's Cybernetic Visor
    .desc = Highly specialized equipment used for providing additional data about the environment (or so they advertise) and causing the user permanent vision problems. This version has everything a CMO might need. It's space proof, has a chemical scanner, alongside a health HUD.
ent-ClothingHeadProtoVisorRD = RD's Cybernetic Visor
    .desc = Highly specialized equipment used for providing additional data about the environment (or so they advertise) and causing the user permanent vision problems. This version has space protection and thats about it.
ent-ClothingHeadProtoVisorService = Service Worker's Cybernetic Visor
    .desc = Highly specialized equipment used for providing additional data about the environment (or so they advertise) and causing the user permanent vision problems. This version comes with basic nourishment and thirst analysis for organic beings.
ent-ClothingHeadProtoVisorSecurity = Officer's Cybernetic Visor
    .desc = Highly specialized equipment used for providing additional data about the environment (or so they advertise) and causing the user permanent vision problems. This version comes with fancy displays for catching criminals.
ent-ClothingHeadProtoVisorBrigmedic = Brigmedic's Cybernetic Visor
    .desc = Highly specialized equipment used for providing additional data about the environment (or so they advertise) and causing the user permanent vision problems. This version, alongside fancy anti-criminal HUD has a health HUD. Perfect for knowing who to not heal.
ent-ClothingHeadProtoVisorHOS = HOS's Cybernetic Visor
    .desc = Highly specialized equipment used for providing additional data about the environment (or so they advertise) and causing the user permanent vision problems. This version has all the gadgets a HOS might want: Space protection and security HUD.
ent-ClothingHeadProtoVisorSalvage = Salvager's Cybernetic Visor
    .desc = Highly specialized equipment used for providing additional data about the environment (or so they advertise) and causing the user permanent vision problems. This version comes with space protection, now go die for cargonia!
ent-ClothingHeadProtoVisorQM = QM's Cybernetic Visor
    .desc = Highly specialized equipment used for providing additional data about the environment (or so they advertise) and causing the user permanent vision problems. This version has space protection for not dying when ATS explodes, although then you may have bigger problems.
ent-ClothingHeadProtoVisorHOP = HOP's Cybernetic Visor
    .desc = Highly specialized equipment used for providing additional data about the environment (or so they advertise) and causing the user permanent vision problems. This version comes with space protection and job identification display.
ent-ClothingHeadProtoVisorCaptain = Captain's Cybernetic Visor
    .desc = Highly specialized equipment used for providing additional data about the environment (or so they advertise) and causing the user permanent vision problems. This version has, space protection and a job identifier build-in.
ent-ClothingHeadProtoVisorNTR = NTR's Cybernetic Visor
    .desc = Highly specialized equipment used for providing additional data about the environment (or so they advertise) and causing the user permanent vision problems. This version is a proof CC is being cheap on you. It has nothing, even the lights of standard models barely work here.
ent-ClothingHeadProtoVisorCentCom = Central Command's Cybernetic Visor
    .desc = Highly specialized equipment used for providing additional data about the environment (or so they advertise) and causing the user permanent vision problems. This version comes with EVERYTHING you would ever want. NOW WE ARE TALKING BABY!
    .suffix = DO NOT MAP
